  "The PR bench's eager per-launch timings are launch-bound and noisy across boots (e.g. TP4 decode p50 41.98 us on c52 boot1, 9.38 us on boot2; base boot1 mid 35.58 us, boot2 15.58 us); they are recorded (pr_bench_eager) but the verdict uses graph replay, as step 7 asks.",
